%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe2d31c0a575d374f9b00d77d5d88faf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1.End
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: After the dust settled, 2 figures emerged from the hill.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: ???
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b973f43e1779ce346b1a51d00261cde4, type: 3}
    text: 'You guys alright? Seems the wildlife got a bit desperate searching for
      food. '
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Olaf
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b973f43e1779ce346b1a51d00261cde4, type: 3}
    text: Name's Olaf, nice to meet you!
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Olaf
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b973f43e1779ce346b1a51d00261cde4, type: 3}
    text: This mage that is responsible for the burnt puppies is Wagner, my hunting
      friend.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Wagner
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 87e2f8bdfc2178042a69742e30c7817c, type: 3}
    text: 'Nice to make your acquaintance. '
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Zavren
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ea391b21d3571b74891285752549baee, type: 3}
    text: Likewise. Name's Zavren, thanks for your help.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Raindorf
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc3daa6a9a1207a429fc0a1b02e63d65, type: 3}
    text: 'I''m Raindorf. Your help will not be forgotten, brother. '
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Abdul
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a4e25b23fb97a46489f95e4bf3dafbd2, type: 3}
    text: We almost had it, but nevertheless thank you. Call me Abdul.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Sicur
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f842b72481fd6043bb45ee3ba848524, type: 3}
    text: Sicur...
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Wagner
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 87e2f8bdfc2178042a69742e30c7817c, type: 3}
    text: When we saw that light, we just had to see what it was about. Glad we made
      it in time, although it is strange that animals would go towards it rather
      than be scared and run away.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Olaf
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b973f43e1779ce346b1a51d00261cde4, type: 3}
    text: 'You guys seem injured, we can take you to our village and patch those
      wounds. It''s not too far. '
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: Abdul
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a4e25b23fb97a46489f95e4bf3dafbd2, type: 3}
    text: That would be great, we could use a shelter from this cold. Lead the way.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
  - speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Olaf and Wagner then guide you towards their village.
    backgroundImage: {fileID: -6133942402064407019, guid: ca0fd372226fa2f4a902a12c3f1710f2, type: 3}
    flashColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    flashFadeInSeconds: -1
    flashHoldSeconds: -1
    flashFadeOutSeconds: -1
